  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation with Albanian Helsinki Committee</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Cooperation with Albanian Helsinki Committee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the role of Albanian Helsinki Committee in protecting and promoting human rights and democracy. Intensify the efforts in increasing the accountability of the institutions through mobilizing citizens and CSOs and through independent and objective monitoring.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rka den albanska Helsingforskommitt&#xe9;ns roll f&#xf6;r att skydda och fr&#xe4;mja m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och demokrati. Intensifiera anstr&#xe4;ngningarna f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka institutionernas ansvarsskyldighet genom att mobilisera medborgare och civila organisationer och genom oberoende och objektiv &#xf6;vervakning.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is: Empowering Civil Society as a key actor in fighting corruption and contributing in the development of the democracy and state of rule of law through positively pressuring the public authorities.

The expected outcome is: increased role and contribution of prominent NGOs (active in fulfilling their mission in human rights,  anti-corruption, democracy, etc.) through developing their capacities in integrating human rights perspective in their work and applying community-based approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
